{
  "root": {
    "data": {
      "id": "b9aa22deba98b3b20c7ac8aca2",
      "text": "JVM面试题"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "data": {
          "id": "b58888b5ceebbf0e68dada0656",
          "text": "JVM垃圾回收算法"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "b0916946-4234-4b81-847e-9cc3c8def8c5",
              "text": "复制算法"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "b1de3128-5f1a-4a94-a3af-5ae63bad8d13",
                  "text": "适用场景"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "5f4b76fc-e704-4498-aa72-0f88549abb80",
                      "text": "适用于年轻代，存活对象较少，不需要频繁移动对象"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "44a4d140-a11e-4ec9-bb13-e89a4fad25ab",
                  "text": "缺点"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "40c5d50b-cd65-44aa-acc3-dfe0328ccf22",
                      "text": "空间利用率不大，只能使用一半的空间"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "4a4a4bba-7d4a-484c-8eb5-33e46881eedd",
                      "text": "需要移动对象，如果存活的对象较多，成本高，效率低"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "bdd282be-f53a-4017-9fcc-6386646a2677",
              "text": "标记-清除"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "a259ef0f-b144-4099-b13d-38c70fe0d7fc",
                  "text": "适用场景"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "9c0ffd11-cd7d-4290-ad9d-4e0252ff945c",
                      "text": "适用于老年代，存活的对象较多"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "17dba528-725b-49b4-8a79-fef315b48fd4",
                  "text": "缺点"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "04c65dc4-4b0f-49e6-8a37-4fc54bccaf8e",
                      "text": "容易产生内存碎片，使得无法申请连续的内存空间"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "55a97e96-54ec-4ddc-9588-a85530c428c8",
                      "text": "扫描了两次空间，一次标记，一次清除"
                    },
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "5ff1df21-97c2-4f34-ad61-2ef223c57e41",
              "text": "标记-整理"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "f1864c5a-2147-4280-87cd-0e35c661a830",
                  "text": "在标记清除的算法基础上做了内存整理操作，避免内存碎片"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "dce183cb-d788-4505-9827-1bf0436520eb",
              "text": "分代收集算法"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "75cba397-3ab3-46af-9faa-79ccf87d376b",
                  "text": "针对新生代和老年代不同的特点，新生代存活对象少，老年代每次清理的存活对象多，不同年代使用不同的算法"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "68a84463-5117-4438-99dd-f804237f1e2c",
                  "text": "新生代使用复制算法，存活对象少，不需要频繁移动对象"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "1e4b7239-d061-40d1-8228-72ee6cd02153",
                  "text": "老年代使用标记清除或者标记整理算法"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "data": {
          "id": "193b56735e689ae86a01d91513",
          "text": "JVM垃圾回收机制"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "8a3e1ea9-2e08-4fb1-87ce-8be0dc363a7d",
              "text": "年轻代eden区域和survior区域的比例"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "1c4d3547-1820-41ce-9412-ea199f240e5b",
                  "text": "年轻代需要分配较大的空间，进行分配担保"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "8a4cc228-fc09-4ebf-9d18-63ebb43915a4",
                  "text": "8：1：1"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "e3247cae-9354-4dc0-9c55-78147223e1ec",
              "text": "对象在堆栈中的内存过程"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "248ded7f-e718-43fa-bc1a-67c9e472de61",
                  "text": "新对象优先分配在Eden区域，除非大对象直接进入老年代"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "1bdce551-8975-4ce3-ac87-3db819799204",
                  "text": "当Eden区域满了，存活对象就会复制到survior区域"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "d058ee10-04ce-4113-ae65-3db2f997fe72",
                  "text": "当Eden区域又满了， 会将Eden区域和survior区域中存活的对象复制到另外一块survior区域中，并清理空间"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "532558f8-b774-4e45-9fe8-7910515344fb",
                  "text": "当一个对象被复制了15次后，就会进入到老年代"
                },
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "67051afb-c0f0-4140-9619-ab2b70f7b6e3",
                  "text": "老年代内存空间满了之后会触发FullGC"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "data": {
          "id": "ba118cba-b966-4cbe-a0c0-c42fd3891794",
          "text": "JVM垃圾回收类型"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "fbdf5014-103c-4f1d-bf9a-95d1416d7110",
              "text": "Minor GC"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "a1381520-c87d-4a58-b4cd-6b0480d574cb",
                  "text": "新生代垃圾回收"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "6b2e5df2-d9a1-4f3c-a572-de1908c2f99b",
              "text": "Full GC"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "8ab01a60-6cef-4537-a8f3-6d22a3e13bae",
                  "text": "整个堆内存进行垃圾回收"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "data": {
          "id": "67ddbcb1-85c9-4478-a0aa-580e9fdcd971",
          "text": "JVM内存结构"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "3f781296-d01f-4550-acef-08032f422d3f",
              "text": "堆内存"
            },
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "a8e4a122-5b54-4665-b454-23c914ea982e",
              "text": "栈内存"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "b1fe2b14-ebb3-4ae1-b301-3f1fcee01d2b",
                  "text": "虚拟机栈"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "data": {
                      "id": "9f34564a-e7aa-4cec-ac3e-81879b13827e",
                      "text": "栈帧"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "data": {
                          "id": "e9c67bc6-b139-4a03-ba1d-1ddac270b8f2",
                          "text": "局部变量表"
                        },
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "data": {
                          "id": "6ea9bb55-748b-41f0-a7fa-6da3864926df",
                          "text": "操作数栈"
                        },
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "data": {
                          "id": "6ab5381e-096a-45ec-8eee-21767fdbc0fd",
                          "text": "动态链接库"
                        },
                        "children": []
                      },
                      {
                        "data": {
                          "id": "c4084909-0769-41cf-a7fd-5281bbe15ca2",
                          "text": "方法出口"
                        },
                        "children": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "data": {
                  "id": "39fe5b3d-9bb6-488a-a746-36123bbbbdcc",
                  "text": "本地方栈"
                },
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "00166591-805a-4a44-84db-2f936f072fa7",
              "text": "程序计数器"
            },
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "id": "bf4709dd-c41c-4ef4-9095-d370737a24b0",
              "text": "方法区"
            },
            "children": []
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
